  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.12.0: new NzBulkCopy API (CreateBulkCopy / WriteToServer) streams prepared rows through the external-table protocol in one transfer, with automatic row-by-row fallback for unsupported values, in-memory DATA frames, progress-safe log draining, sync/async overloads and a BulkInsert connection option. Documentation and live/benchmark tests added.",
